OL,3,GNEWSACricketer 'proud to give back'
OL,4,Aafter son's surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cricketer has said he wants to "give
OL,7,Fback" to those who helped repair his
OL,8,Fnewborn son's cleft lip and palate.
OL,10,FTom Kohler-Cadmore, who plays for
OL,11,FSomerset, will swap his bat for golf
OL,12,Fclubs to raise money for Cleft Lip and
OL,13,FPalate Action (CLAPA), and awareness
OL,14,Fabout the condition.
OL,16,FHis son, Dougie, has had two operations
OL,17,Fto correct the condition, which is a
OL,18,Fgap or split in the upper lip and/or
OL,19,Froof of the mouth (palate) that is
OL,20,Fpresent from birth.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
